        "en": "Rapid obedience and leash manners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report noticeable behavioral improvements within the first few weeks, including reliable recall, solid loose-leash walking, and calm responses to distractions. Clients praise the curriculum for successfully preparing dogs for Canine Good Citizen certification and service tasks."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Positive reinforcement for all breeds"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe training sessions as engaging and enjoyable, noting that young puppies and high-energy rescue dogs eagerly look forward to lessons. The positive reinforcement approach helps fearful or reactive animals build confidence without stress or intimidation."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Top Dog Training teach young puppies?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, many clients enrolled puppies as young as three months old to establish crate training, potty routines, and foundational commands."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the program prepare dogs for Canine Good Citizen testing?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers mention successfully training their dogs with Jay to pass the Canine Good Citizen test and prepare for service work."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are owners included in the training process?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, Jay actively trains family members and children to ensure commands and routines are reinforced consistently at home."
